Package: xgx
Type: Package
Title: Exploratory Graphics (xGx) Website
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: c(
    person("Andrew", "Stein", email = "andy.stein@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Alison", "Margolskee", role = "aut"),
    person("Novartis Pharma AG", role = "cph"))
Description: This is not an R package. The DESCRIPTION exists so that the
    packages required to render the xGx website are recorded in one
    authoritative place, rather than being rediscovered by grepping the
    Rmarkdown sources. CI installs the hard dependencies from here, and
    contributors can get a local machine in sync with
    pak::local_install_deps(). Note that rxode2 is a soft dependency: it is
    needed only to regenerate the datasets in Data/ via PKPD_Datasets.Rmd,
    not to build the site.
